<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="COL" style="id">- Mbunga Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Wakolosai</para>
  <para style="toc3">Wako</para>
  <para style="toc2">Wakolosai</para>
  <para style="toc1">Lihamba lya Paulo kwa Wakolosai</para>
  <para style="mt2">Lihamba lya Paulo kwa</para>
  <para style="mt1">Wakolosai</para>
  <para style="imt">Ulongulelo wa Wakolosai</para>
  <para style="ip">Lihamba lya wakolosai liyandikilwi na Mndumindumi Paulo kusula gha 1:1. Ayandikili lihamba hali lipindi awelili mukihungo, inguwesekana iwelili haku kumlima Loma, kumachuva gha isitini badili gha kuweleka kwa Kilisito. Lihamba ghali kwa Wakolosai pamonga na kwa Waefesu na kwa Filimoni zingukemwa lihamba lya mgelesa kwaikiva lipindi Paulo anguyandika awelili mukihungo. Ayandikili lihamba hali kwa lipinga lya wandu wamkwinila kilisito lya haku kumlima wa Kolosai, Paulo atumbulili ng'ogha lipinga lya wamkwinila Kilisito haku Kolosai, handa ailongelili kusula gha 2:1, ila ajilolile yiwa angupalwa kulivula hali lipinga. Inguwesekana yiwa Epafula ndiwa mweni kutumbulisa lipinga lya wamkwinila Kilisito lipindi awelili akihuma haku Kolosai.</para>
  <para style="ip">Paulo alikangasili na mavulo gha uhwangi kulipinga lya wakwinila Kilisito haku Kolosai. Na kayandika kwa utali kunani gha mavulo hagha. Haku kuwelile na lipinga lya Wayahudi weni kumkwinila Kilisito weni wawelile wakiwalasimisa wakilisito waghangi weni kumkwinila Kilisito wakovekeli malaghilo gha Wayahudi kuhuma lilaghano lya dahile, nesunesu kuyingisa jandu. Paulo ayandikile yiwa mundu yeyosi mweni kumkwinila Kilisito kangupala ng'ogha kindu chochosi ila angumpala Yesu ili ajumilwi kuulongolo gha Sapanga kusula gha 1:15-20 na yala mavulo yeni kuhuma kumawachilo gha kimundu yangutanga ng'ogha chochosi kusula gha 2:28.</para>
  <para style="iot">Gha Mghati</para>
  <para style="io">Paulo angutumbula lihamba kwa kujambusa Lipinga lya wandu weni kumkwinila Kilisito haku Kolosai kusula gha 1:1-2</para>
  <para style="io">Kangi anguyandika kwa ukulu wa Kilisito nesunesu vila ndambu gha kuyanga mavulo gha uhwangi haku kusula gha 1:3-3:4</para>
  <para style="io">Handa iwela kulihamba wekaweka Paulo anguyandika nusu gha milando kulongelela ndambu wangupalwa kulama wandu weni kumkwinila Kilisito kusula gha 3:5-4:6</para>
  <para style="io">Paulo anguhyomola kwa jambuso, na angulaghila lihamba hali lisomwi kwa lilowi kumapinga maghangi gha wandu wamkwinila Kilisito kusula gha 4:7-18</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="COL 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 1:1" />Nenga Paulo mndumindumi wa Yesu kilisito. Nihaghulilwi kuwela mndumindumi handa Sapanga aipalile, ninguwayandikila lihamba hali nikiwela pamonga na mlongu ghangu Timoseo,<verse eid="COL 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 1:2" />tunguwayandikila mwenga wandu weni kumkwilila Sapanga muwela haku Kolosai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="COL 1:2">Tunguwapalila umaha na kwa kulikala kwa kuponga kweni kuhuma kwa Sapanga Tati wa twenga.<verse eid="COL 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mayupo gha kushukwile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 1:3" />Machuwa hyogha patuyupa kwaikiva gha mwenga tungumshukwile Sapanga,Tati wa Bambu wa twenga Yesu Kilisito, <verse eid="COL 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 1:4" />twenga tuyughanila vila mwenga mumkwinilile Yesu kilisito, na upalu muulangiha kwa wakwinila wogha wa Sapanga. <verse eid="COL 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 1:5" />Kukwinila kwa mwenga na kulikala kwa upalo kwa mwenga, kunguhuma kulitumaini lya mwenga yiwa mtepokela highili zila Sapanga kawavikila kundumba, mhyoghanila kala habali hai kupitila ujumbi wa chakaka tuwatangasilili ingumaanisa hila Habali Maha. <verse eid="COL 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 1:6" />Habali hazi zyeni kuhika kwa mwenga, zingulandala kumlimawogha. Zinguwaghalambula wandu ili wamkwinili Sapanga handa zigholile kwa mwenga kuhuma pala mhyoghanilile habali zya umaha wa Sapanga na kuumanya uchakaka ghaki vila uwela. <verse eid="COL 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 1:7" />Mjivulili umaha wa Sapanga kuhuma kwa yala agholili Epafula, mndumindumi myetu yula tungumpala kangi kamchakaka ku Kilisito kwaikiva gha mwenga, <verse eid="COL 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 1:8" />mweni katulongela habali zya upalo wa mwenga awapeghili Mpumulo wa Sapanga.<verse eid="COL 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 1:9" />Kuhuma lipindi lila patuhyoghanila kukwinila kwa mwenga, twenga tuleka ng'ogha kuwayupila mwenga ili Sapanga awapeghi mwenga kumanya kila angukipala kuluhala lwogha na umanyi wa weni kuhuma kwa Mpumulo wa Sapanga. <verse eid="COL 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 1:10" />Ndiwa mtewesa kulikala vila Bambu angupala, na kughola kwa njila yeyosi yeni kumhekelesa. Kulama kwa mwenga kutemhekelesa kwa mahengu maheli gha mwenga, kangi mteyendelela kummanya Sapanga. <verse eid="COL 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 1:11" />Tungumyupa Sapanga kwa uwesa ghaki mkulu, awatangi muwesi kufumilila hyogha. <verse eid="COL 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 1:12" />Kangi mumshukwile Tati kwa luheku, mweni kawawesesa na mwenga muweli kuunkosi wa mhana. <verse eid="COL 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 1:13" />Mweni atukombolili kuulongosi wa Lihyukana, akatuyegha kuulongosi wa Mwana ghaki mpalwa Yesu kilisito. <verse eid="COL 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 1:14" />Hinu kwa mweni tungukombolwa, ingumaanisa sambi syetu zinguhululwa.<verse eid="COL 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lihengu na ukulu wa Kilisito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 1:15" />Kilisito ni mlandano wa Sapanga mweni kuwoneka ng'ogha, mweni awelili pambila gha kulumbwa viumbi vyogha na ndiwa kilongosi wa viumbi vyogha. <verse eid="COL 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 1:16" />Kupitila hayu, Sapanga alumbili vindu vyogha, vila vya kunani na vila vya kumlima pamonga na vila vinguwoneka na vila vinguwoneka ng'ogha na weni uwesa na vilongosi wakulu na weni makakala vyogha vilumbilwi kupitila mweni na kwaikiva gha mweni. <verse eid="COL 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 1:17" />Kilisito awelili pambila gha hindu hyogha kulumbwa na kupitila mweni vindu vyogha vingikonganika. <verse eid="COL 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 1:18" />Mweni ni kilongosi wa wandu weni kumkwinila, na mweni ni mtumbulo wa hagha wandu weni kumkwinila, hila hila mweni ni wa mtumbulo kuhindulwa ili aweli mkulu kunani gha vindu vyogha. <verse eid="COL 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="COL 1:19" />Hinu Sapanga apalili ulungu ghaki ulikali mghati gha Mwana. <verse eid="COL 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="COL 1:20" />Kupitila Yesu kilisito Sapanga avikonganisili vindu vyogha na mweni na kwa kihu kyaki pala mlipingika akatughola tulikali kwa kuponga, vindu vyogha viwela kundumba na vya pahi.<verse eid="COL 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="COL 1:21" />Haku mtumbulo mwenga muwelili kutali na Sapanga na muwelili wahakata ghaki kwaikiva gha mawachilo gha mwenga mahakata na kughola matendu mahakata. <verse eid="COL 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="COL 1:22" />Ila hinaa, Sapanga kawakonganisa mwenga na mweni kwa kupitila kihu kya mhigha ghaki wa kuweleka, agholile nagha ili awayeghi kwaki wakiwela wamaha na kuwela ng'ogha na mahakata. <verse eid="COL 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="COL 1:23" />Hinu mngupalwa kuyendelela, na kukwinila uchakaka kulitumaini, hilahila mkotoho kuyumbila kulitumaini lila mlipokelili lipindi pamyughanila Habali Maha. Nenga Paulo niwela mndumindumi wa Habali Maha hai itangasilwi kwa kila mundu kumlima wogha hau.<verse eid="COL 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lihengu lya Paulo kwa wandu wamkwinila Kilisito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="COL 1:24" />Hinaa ninguhekelela kuhakilwa kwaikiva gha mwenga, na kupitila higha ghangu ningutimilisa ghala yalepelili kumahakilo gha Yesu kilisito kwaikiva gha mwenga weni kumkwinila Kilisito. <verse eid="COL 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="COL 1:25" />Nenga nigholilwi kuwela mtumikila wa lipinga lya wandu weni kumkwinila Kilisito kukovekelana na lihengu lila Sapanga anipeghili ili kuwayeghela mwenga Habali Maha vila ingupalwa. <verse eid="COL 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="COL 1:26" />Haki ndiwa kifisu kiwelili kifiswa kuhuma haku dahile na kwa viweleka vitangala, ila hinaa ihighiliswa kwa wandu wahaghulilwi kughola lihengu lya Sapanga, <verse eid="COL 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="COL 1:27" />mweni kapala kuwamanyisa unaisa na ukulu wa kifisu haki kyeni kulandala kwa wandu wawela ng'ogha Wayahudi, na kifisu kyeni ni haki, Kilisito kuwela mghati gha mwenga na mwenga mtekonganika kuukulu wa Sapanga. <verse eid="COL 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="COL 1:28" />Twenga tungumtangasa hayu Kilisito kwa wandu wogha, tunguwakalipila na kuwavula wogha kwa malangu hyogha, ili tuwesi kumlongela kila mundu milando gha Sapanga akiwela kanguimanya maha na kakongana na Kilisito. <verse eid="COL 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="COL 1:29" />Kukovekelana na hagha, nenga ningukimbanika nesu kughola mahengu, kunu ningulidumbila makakala gha Kilisito yeni kughola mahengu mghati ghangu.<verse eid="COL 1:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="COL 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 2:1" />Nenga ningupala mmanyi vila ningughola mahengu kwa kuyangala kwaikiva gha mwenga na hilahila kwa wandu wa haku Lawodikiya na kwa wandu wogha weni kunilola ng'ogha kwa mihu. <verse eid="COL 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 2:2" />Ningughola nagha ili niwatayi moyu, na wakonganiswi pamonga kuupalo, na wawesi kumanya kifisu kya Sapanga. Mghalu hau ufisilwi ndiwa Kilisito mweni. <verse eid="COL 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 2:3" />Mghati ghaki ndiwa kufiswa luhala na umanyi.<verse eid="COL 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 2:4" />Hinu ninguwalongela, mkotoho kujumila kululunganywa na mundu yoyosi yula kwa milando gha uhwangi hata handa ni maheli nesu. <verse eid="COL 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 2:5" />Ningulonga nagha pamonga na yiwa niwela ng'ogha na mwenga, ila mawachilo gha nenga yawela pamonga na mwenga. Ninguhekelela kwaikiva ninguhyoghanila umonga wa mwenga ugangamala kukukongana na Kilisito.<verse eid="COL 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ngalilu hyonu kukukongana na Kilisito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 2:6" />Hinu handa mwenga mumjumila Kilisito Yesu aweli Bambu wa mwenga, myendeleli kumkovekela mweni. <verse eid="COL 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 2:7" />Kangi muyendeleli kuwela mgangamala kukumkwinila Kilisito, na myendeleli kuivula nesu kunani gha mweni.<verse eid="COL 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 2:8" />Mliloli, mundu yoyosi akotoho kuwaghola mwenga wahusutu kwa mavulo ghaki gha helahela na uhwangi, mavulo yenikuhuma kwa wagogolo wa dahile na yeni kulongoswa na mahoka na ng'ogha mavulo gha Kilisito mweni. <verse eid="COL 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 2:9" />Mghati mwa Kilisito kuumundu ghaki, kuwela na utimila wogha wa Sapanga, <verse eid="COL 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 2:10" />na mwenga mpata ukomu wogha kwa kukongana na mweni. Mweni angulongosa weni makakala wogha na wakulu wogha.<verse eid="COL 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 2:11" />Kukukongana na Kilisito, mwenga myingiswa jandu, ila kuyingiswa haku jandu ng'ogha kula kweni kugholwa na wandu ila haku kungugholwa na Kilisito na itetukombola kuhuma kusambi. <verse eid="COL 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 2:12" />Hinu pambatiswili mkasikwa pamonga na mweni Kilisito, na pambatisilwi mkahinduka pamonga na mweni kwaikiva mkwinilili makakala gha Sapanga yeni kumhindula Kilisito. <verse eid="COL 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 2:13" />Haku dahile muwelili muhova kwa mighalu gha kiulungu kwa sambi msigholile na kwaikiva muwelile wandu wa milima mighangi. Ila Sapanga kawapegha mwenga ukomu pamonga na Kilisito mweni Kilisito. Akatulekisela sambi sya twenga zyogha. <verse eid="COL 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 2:14" />Pala ataghilile kutali lila lihamba lyeni kuyandikwa malaghilo gha kutusitaki, kangi Sapanga kahumisa ngumbu ngumbu hai na kuigongomelela kulipingika. <verse eid="COL 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 2:15" />Haku kulipingika Kilisito awapokili makakala ghao hagha mihoka na vilongosi wakulu, awatayili honi kuulongolo gha wandu kwa kuwakulughula handa wahusutu kumwanja gha usindi ghaki.<verse eid="COL 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 2:16" />Hinu, mkotoho kujumila mundu yoyosi awavikili laghilo kunani gha mulyu au vindu fya kunywegha, lichuwa lya mhambu, na lichuwa lya kuwoneka kwa mwehi wahyonu au lichuwa lya kupumulila. <verse eid="COL 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 2:17" />Mighalu hai hyogha ni mlandanu wa yala yatehika, uchakaka unguwoneka kwa Kilisito mweni. <verse eid="COL 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 2:18" />Mkotoho kumhyoghanila mundu yeyosi mweni kulitutumula yiwa kamaha kwa unyalinyali na uhwangi, na kuwatundamila watumikila wa kundumba wa Sapanga kunu akiyendelela kumawachilo ghaki. Hayu kandyungi kwa mawachilo mahakata gha kumlimawogha, <verse eid="COL 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="COL 2:19" />kangi hayu kalihumisa kwa Kilisito mweni kulongosa wandu ghaki handa mutu vila ungulongosa mhigha. Kuhuma kwa Kilisito mhigha wogha ungupokela mulyo na kukula kangi anguukonganisa mhigha wogha na vikongonu pamonga na misipa, havi ndiwa Sapanga angupala.<verse eid="COL 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kulama na kuhova pamonga na Kilisito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="COL 2:20" />Hinu kwaikiva mwenga muhovili pamonga na Kilisito na kukombolwa kuhuma kuulongosi wa Lihyukana na wakulu wa mlima wogha hau. Ghuli kwa kyani mngulikala kangi handa vila mwenga mumkwinila ng'ogha Sapanga? Kwa kyani mngujumila kuvikilwa malaghilo handa nagha, <verse eid="COL 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="COL 2:21" />“Mkotoho kukola haki, na Mkotoho kuyesa kila, na mkotoho kukiyavisa kila!” <verse eid="COL 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="COL 2:22" />Malaghilo handa hagha ni mighalu yeni kuyalamika, hagha ni malaghilo na mavulo gha wandu hela, <verse eid="COL 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="COL 2:23" />ni chakaka wandu weni kukovekela mighalu handa hai wanguwoneka yiwa wawela na luhala, wangukovekela kumyupa Sapanga kwa njila ghao weni, unyali nyali na kuulongosa mhigha kwa kukalipa. Ila mighalu hai wajivikila inguwesa ng'ogha kungingama lumatamata luhakata lya mhigha.<verse eid="COL 2:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="COL 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 3:1" />Hinu, ikiwela Sapanga kawahindula kungalilu hyonu pamonga na Kilisito, muwachile mighalu iwela kundumba, kula Kilisito angulongosa pamonga na Sapanga. <verse eid="COL 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 3:2" />Muwachili kupokela mighalu gha kundumba na ng'ogha mighalu gha baha mumlima wogha, <verse eid="COL 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 3:3" />kwaikva mwenga mhova na ngalilu gha mwenga ihighwa pamonga na Kilisito ku Sapanga. <verse eid="COL 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 3:4" />Ukomu wa mwenga uwela kwa Kilisito, paatehika kangi, mtepokela pamonga na mweni kuukulu ghaki.<verse eid="COL 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ngalilu gha dahile na ngalilu hyonu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 3:5" />Mleki kughola vila mihigha gha mwenga ingupala, handa vila, ngongola na uhakata na luhujulu lihakata na lumatamata lihakata na lumatamata mighalu hai hyogha ni handa kuyupa mang'omung'omu. <verse eid="COL 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 3:6" />Lilaka lya Sapanga linguwahikila wandu handa hagha. <verse eid="COL 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 3:7" />Mwenga hilahila pala dahile mlamili kwa kughola mighalu hai.<verse eid="COL 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 3:8" />Ila hinaa, mngupalwa kuleka kughola mighalu hai hyogha, lilaka na utatala na wifu na malongelo yeni malighu. <verse eid="COL 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 3:9" />Mkotoho kulongelana uhwangi, kwaikiva mwenga mleka hila mighalu mihakata gha dahile na matendu ghaki hyogha. <verse eid="COL 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 3:10" />Hinaa mtumbula ngalilu hyonu. Sapanga ndiwa anguwawesesa kungalilu hai hyonu ili muwese kuwela handa mweni kwa kummanya mweni kwa maheli. <verse eid="COL 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 3:11" />Kumghalu hau, kwahela mlekanu paghati gha Mgiliki na myahudi, yula kayingiswa jandu na yula kayingiswa jandu ng'ogha, yula msomi na msomi ng'ogha, muhusutu na mundu pekesu. Kilisito ni kila kindu na kawela kukila kindu.<verse eid="COL 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 3:12" />Mwenga ni wandu ghaki Sapanga, mweni awapalili na kuwahaghula. Kwa nagha, muweli na moyu wa luhungu na umaha na kunyenyekela na unyalinyali pamonga na ufumilifu. <verse eid="COL 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 3:13" />Mpapilane mihighu na kulekeselana mahakata ikiva mmonga wamwenga kamgholela myaki mahakata, lekeselana handa vila Bambu awalekeselanilili mwenga. <verse eid="COL 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 3:14" />Pamonga na hagha hyogha, muweli na upalo, kwaikiva upalo ungukonganisa kila kindu kuumonga hula wa chakaka. <verse eid="COL 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 3:15" />Kuponga kunguhuma kwa Kilisito, kulongosi mioyu gha mwenga, mwenga muwela mhigha mmonga hinu mkemwa kulikala kwa kuponga, kangi muweli wandu weni kumshukwile Sapanga. <verse eid="COL 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 3:16" />Ujumbi wa Kilisito na utami mghati mwa mwenga pamonga na luhala lyaki lyogha. Mlongelane mavulo hagha na myalole kwa uchakaka mwenga kwa mwenga kwa luhala lyogha, mkiyimba sabuli, nyimbu sya sifwa na nyimbu zila zinguweseswa na Mpumulo na kumyimbila Sapanga kwa kumshukwile kumioyu gha mwenga. <verse eid="COL 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 3:17" />Mghalu wowose mngughola au mngulonga, mgholi mkimanya mngumgholela Bambu Yesu, kunu mkimshukwile Sapanga Tati kupitila mweni.<verse eid="COL 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ngalilu maheli kukaya zya Wakilisito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 3:18" />Wahumbu muwatundamili wangwana wa mwenga, ndiwa ingupalwa kwa wandu weni kumkwinila Bambu Yesu.<verse eid="COL 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="COL 3:19" />Mwenga wangwana, muwapali wahumbu wa mwenga, na mkotoho kuwela na lilaka kwa weni.<verse eid="COL 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="COL 3:20" />Mwenga wana, muwatundamili walela wa mwenga kumighalu hyogha, kwaikiva kughola nagha kungumhekelesa Bambu.<verse eid="COL 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="COL 3:21" />Mwenga akina tati mkotoho kuwaghola wana wa mwenga kuwela na lilaka, kwaikiva wanguwesa kuwachila yiwa wawesa ng'ogha kughola maheli kindu chochose.<verse eid="COL 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="COL 3:22" />Mwenga wahusutu, muwatundamili wakulu wa mwenga kumighalu hyogha. Mgholi nagha ng'ogha kwaikiva wanguwalola, ng'ogha kwa kuhakula kupalwa na weni, ila kwa uchakaka na kumyupa Bambu. <verse eid="COL 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="COL 3:23" />Lolosi ungulighola, ughole kwa uchakaka handa wandu weni kumtumikila Bambu na ng'ogha mundu. <verse eid="COL 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="COL 3:24" />Mmanyi yiwa Bambu atewapegha hupo hila awalongelili kuwapegha watumikila ghaki. Kwaikiva mwenga mungumtumikila Kilisito Bambu wa mwenga. <verse eid="COL 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="COL 3:25" />Mghola mahakata atepokela mahakata kukovekela na vila agholili. Kwaikiva Sapanga kahela ubaghula.<verse eid="COL 3:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="COL 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 4:1" />Mwenga wakulu, muwagholeli wahusutu wa mwenga vila ingupalwa, na mwenga hilahila mkumbwike muwela na Bambu kundumba.<verse eid="COL 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malaghilo maghangi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 4:2" />Katu mkotoho kuleka kuyupa machuwa hyogha, mkali mihu na kuwela wandu wa kushukwile. <verse eid="COL 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 4:3" />Hilahila, mtuyupile na twenga ili Sapanga atuwoposeleli njila gha kutangasa lilando lyaki, na kutangasa habali zya Kilisito zyeni kuwela zihighwa haku dahile. Na nenga niwopwa kwaikiva gha kutangasa Habali Maha. <verse eid="COL 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 4:4" />Hinu, mumyupi Sapanga ili niwese kulonga handa vila ingupalwa kulongelwa na wandu wawesi kumanya lipalalipala.<verse eid="COL 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 4:5" />Lipindi mnguwela na wandu weni kumkwinila ng'ogha Kilisito, mlangihi ndyangilu maheli kangi mtumili lipindi hali kuwatanga. <verse eid="COL 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 4:6" />Machuwa hyogha mlongele mighalu maheli yanguwesa kutanga waghangi, hilahila muwese kuwayanga maheli wandu wogha wangupala kumanya.<verse eid="COL 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jambusu lya kuyomolela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 4:7" />Mlongo wa twenga mpalwa Tukiko, mghola lihengu mchakaka yula tungughola lihengu lya Bambu Yesu pamonga, atewalongela habali zya nenga zyogha. <verse eid="COL 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 4:8" />Ningumyegha kwa mwenga kwa lukani hali, ili mpati kumanya ndyangilu gha twenga na kangi awatayi moyu. <verse eid="COL 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 4:9" />Anguhika pamonga na Onesimo, mlongo wa twenga mpalwa na mchakaka, hayu ni mweni kaya wa mmbwani wa mwenga, weni watewalongela mighalu hyogha ingugholeka haku kwa twenga.<verse eid="COL 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 4:10" />Alisitaliko mweni kuwela muwopwa pamonga na nenga anguwajambusa, hilahila Maliko mlongo ghaki Balinaba na mweni anguwajambusa, ningumanya myoghanila kala habali ghaki, paakihika kwa mwenga mumpokeli maheli. <verse eid="COL 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 4:11" />Na mweni Yoshuwa mweni kukemwa Yusito anguwajambusa. Wandu hagha waitatu ni Wayahudi wekayao wangughola lihengu pamonga na nenga kwaikiva gha unkosi wa Sapanga, wandu hagha wanipeghili mtanga mkulu.<verse eid="COL 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 4:12" />Epafula, mweni kaya wa haku kwa mwenga, mghola lihengu wa Yesu Kilisito, anguwajambusa. Machuwa hyogha anguwayupila kwa makakala, ili mgangamale kuukwinila na mkamali kimpumulo na mkotoho kuwela na holu kukughola hyogha anguyapala Sapanga. <verse eid="COL 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 4:13" />Ninguwesa kumlongelela maheli yiwa angughola kaghola lihengu kwa makakala kwaikiva gha mwenga na kwa wandu wa Lawodikia na Hiyelapoli. <verse eid="COL 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 4:14" />Lukasi, yula mlamisa tungumpala anguwajambusa na Dema hilahila anguwajambusa.<verse eid="COL 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 4:15" />Muwajambusi walongo wa haku ku Lawodikia. Kangi mumjambusi mhacha Nimfa pamonga na lipinga lyogha lya wakwinila lingukonganika ukaya kwa mweni. <verse eid="COL 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 4:16" />Pamyomola kusoma lihamba hali, lasima muwapeghi wayenu kumapinga gha wandu wamkwinila Kilisito wa haku Laodikia na weni waisomi, na lihamba lila niwayandikili weni wawapeghi ili na mwenga muisomi. <verse eid="COL 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 4:17" />Mumlongeli Alikipo havi, “Ugholi maheli lila lihengu lya kutumikila akupeghili Bambu, ili uitimilisi.”<verse eid="COL 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 4:18" />Nenga, Paulo ninguwayandikila majambuso hagha kwa liwoku lyangu mweni. Mngumbuki kuniyupila nikiwela hamu mkihungu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="COL 4:18">Nawayupila umaha wa Sapanga uweli na mwenga.<verse eid="COL 4:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 4" />
</usx>